{"id":"2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features","date":"2026-10-23","topic":"design","region":"americas","headline":"Mexican university building features Gothic architecture design","source":{"name":"Dezeen","url":"https://www.dezeen.com/2026/10/22/jonathan-corral-arquitectos-uad-alamedas-durango/"},"accent":"us","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"A new school building opens in Mexico now.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","M","M","M"],"dur":3.29,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.38,0.74,1.2,1.76,2.1,2.56]},{"text":"The design uses ideas from old church windows.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.4,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.36,0.8,1.34,1.8,2.12,2.48]},{"text":"The tall tower has eight levels and rooms.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":2.81,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.3,0.78,1.14,1.44,1.82,2.12]},{"text":"Students study law and art inside here today.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":3.5,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.68,1.12,1.52,1.82,2.28,2.62]}],"bands":{"core1000":91,"core1800":3,"ngsl":3,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"A new school building","title":"Subject-Verb Agreement with Singular Nouns","note":"When the subject is singular (like 'building'), the present tense verb needs an 's' at the end. Here, 'building opens' shows this basic rule in action."},{"i":3,"focus":"inside here today","title":"Using Multiple Adverbs of Place and Time","note":"You can put more than one modifier at the end of a sentence. Place comes first ('inside here'), and time comes last ('today')."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"A Mexican design studio finished a new university building.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t2-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":4.22,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.62,0.98,1.66,2.16,2.46,2.72,3.34]},{"text":"The tall tower looks like old European church windows.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.79,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.34,0.88,1.24,1.54,1.86,2.46,2.9]},{"text":"Students will study many subjects inside the eight levels.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.6,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.56,0.84,1.2,1.76,2.32,2.66,2.88]},{"text":"The front has glass panels and a metal screen.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.18,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.38,0.72,1.04,1.6,2.02,2.12,2.38]},{"text":"Visitors can enjoy views from the top area.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.08,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.28,0.64,0.92,1.32,1.74,1.86,2.06]}],"bands":{"core1000":81,"core1800":10,"ngsl":7,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":2},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"will study","title":"Expressing Future Actions with Will","note":"Use 'will' before a base verb to talk about future plans or actions. In this sentence, 'will study' tells us what students are going to do later."},{"i":4,"focus":"can enjoy","title":"Showing Ability with Modal Can","note":"The modal verb 'can' is placed before the main verb to show possibility or ability. Here, 'can enjoy' means visitors can look at the views if they go there."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"Jonathan Corral Arquitectos has completed a striking educational tower in Mexico.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t3-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":6.03,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.48,1.14,2.02,2.46,2.9,3.22,3.64,4.14,4.98,5.32]},{"text":"The new structure features a shaped outer wall inspired by old church windows.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.11,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.24,0.64,1.14,1.44,1.78,2.08,2.54,3.1,3.64,3.94,4.28]},{"text":"This building stands near a famous tree-lined public path in the city.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.06,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.12,0.4,0.76,1.12,1.34,1.81,2.54,2.86,3.3,3.56,3.64]},{"text":"Inside the eight levels, students find study rooms, meeting spaces, and food areas.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t3-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.31,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.5,0.74,1.44,1.82,2.08,2.42,3.22,3.44,4.26,4.38,4.6]},{"text":"The front side combines grey panels with dark metal screens.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.69,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.3,0.62,1.02,1.46,1.88,2.3,2.56,2.9]},{"text":"A top outdoor area offers visitors wonderful views of the surrounding urban landscape.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.49,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.0,0.3,0.62,1.16,1.6,1.98,2.44,2.94,3.22,3.34,3.72,4.18]}],"bands":{"core1000":75,"core1800":9,"ngsl":11,"tsl":1,"nawl":1,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"has completed","title":"Present Perfect for Recent Completion","note":"Use 'has' plus a past participle to show an action that is recently finished and important now. 'Has completed' tells us the building is newly done."},{"i":5,"focus":"offers visitors wonderful views","title":"Double Objects: Indirect and Direct","note":"Some verbs like 'offer' can take two objects without a preposition. 'Visitors' is the indirect object (who receives), and 'wonderful views' is the direct object."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"Mexican studio Jonathan Corral Arquitectos has completed the new UAD Alamedas Tower.","voice":null,"roles":["S","S","S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":null,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null},{"text":"The building features a unique outer wall that draws inspiration from historical stained glass.","voice":null,"roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","S","V","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":null,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null},{"text":"Spanning eight levels, the triangular structure houses study rooms, offices, and large halls.","voice":null,"roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":null,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null},{"text":"The exterior combines grey panels, black metal screens, and clear glass windows.","voice":null,"roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":null,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null},{"text":"Inside the main entrance, visitors discover a central hall with special glass railings.","voice":null,"roles":["M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":null,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null},{"text":"Exposed concrete walls and wooden ceilings highlight the interior construction methods.","voice":null,"roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":null,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null},{"text":"A top outdoor space provides a gathering area with views across the city.","voice":null,"roles":["S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":null,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null}],"bands":{"core1000":61,"core1800":16,"ngsl":12,"tsl":4,"nawl":2,"beyond":5},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"that draws","title":"Defining Relative Clauses with That","note":"The word 'that' introduces a relative clause that describes 'a unique outer wall'. It acts as the subject of the mini-clause 'draws inspiration'."},{"i":2,"focus":"Spanning eight levels,","title":"Participial Phrases as Introductory Modifiers","note":"Starting a sentence with an '-ing' verb phrase is a great way to describe an action happening at the same time. 'Spanning eight levels' describes the structure."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"Mexican design practice Jonathan Corral Arquitectos has completed the striking UAD Alamedas Tower.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t5-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.96,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.52,0.88,1.52,2.18,2.86,3.72,4.3,4.78,5.06,5.5,6.6,7.4]},{"text":"Positioned beside a prominent urban public path, the triangular building features a carefully shaped glass outer wall.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t5-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.38,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.46,0.6,0.6,1.32,1.72,2.1,3.12,3.22,3.58,4.22,4.68,4.92,5.34,5.86,6.3,6.74]},{"text":"The exterior design translates the compositional logic of historical stained-glass windows into a contemporary scale.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t5-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.95,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.42,0.7,1.42,2.06,2.4,3.14,3.56,3.84,4.45,5.22,5.66,6.42,6.6,7.0]},{"text":"Spanning eight levels and a basement, the facility accommodates diverse spaces including study rooms and large halls.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t5-3.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.24,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.66,1.02,1.28,1.38,2.26,2.36,2.7,3.5,3.76,4.34,5.18,5.56,5.92,6.24,6.44]},{"text":"Along the main side, grey panels contrast with dark metal screens and transparent glass.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t5-4.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.73,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.14,0.36,0.54,1.2,1.5,1.92,2.5,2.92,3.22,3.52,3.98,4.42,4.82]},{"text":"Upon entering, visitors encounter a full-height central hall framed by walkways with special glass railings.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t5-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.79,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.52,1.3,1.66,2.1,2.24,3.06,3.52,3.88,4.22,4.54,5.06,5.36,5.66,6.0]},{"text":"Exposed concrete and wooden ceilings throughout the interior celebrate the underlying construction methods.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t5-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.18,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.72,1.0,1.54,1.78,2.14,2.62,2.84,3.22,4.02,4.36,4.78,5.3]},{"text":"Capping the structure, a top outdoor space offers panoramic views of the surrounding cityscape.","voice":"voice/2026-10-23-design-mexican-university-building-features/t5-7.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","S","S","S","S","M","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.97,"voiceJa":null,"durJa":null,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.42,1.16,1.2,1.48,1.84,2.38,2.78,3.6,3.86,4.2,4.3,4.66]}],"bands":{"core1000":55,"core1800":15,"ngsl":15,"tsl":5,"nawl":3,"beyond":7},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"Positioned beside a prominent urban public path,","title":"Past Participle Phrases as Modifiers","note":"Starting with a past participle ('positioned') creates a professional descriptive phrase. It tells us the location and state of the building before the main action."},{"i":5,"focus":"framed by walkways","title":"Reduced Relative Clauses with Participles","note":"The phrase 'framed by walkways' is a short way of saying 'which is framed by walkways'. It modifies 'central hall' without needing 'which is'."}]}},"glossary":[{"word":"studio","lemma":"studio","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈstudiˌoʊ/","definition":"An office or workplace for artists or designers.","tiers":["t2","t3","t4","t5"]},{"word":"exterior","lemma":"exterior","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ɪkˈstɪriər/","definition":"The outside part or surface of something.","tiers":["t3","t4","t5"]},{"word":"structure","lemma":"structure","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈstrʌktʃər/","definition":"A building or other object constructed from several parts.","tiers":["t3","t4","t5"]},{"word":"landscape","lemma":"landscape","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈlændˌskeɪp/","definition":"All the visible features of an area of land.","tiers":["t3","t4","t5"]},{"word":"facility","lemma":"facility","pos":"noun","ipa":"/fəˈsɪləti/","definition":"A place or building built for a specific purpose.","tiers":["t4","t5"]}],"words":{"a":{"l":"a","p":"det","i":"/ə/","d":"one, used before nouns","b":"core1000","img":null},"new":{"l":"new","p":"adj","i":"/nuː/","d":"recently made or built","b":"core1000","img":"art/words/new.jpg"},"school":{"l":"school","p":"noun","i":"/skuːl/","d":"a place for education","b":"core1000","img":"art/words/school.jpg"},"building":{"l":"building","p":"noun","i":"/ˈbɪldɪŋ/","d":"a structure with walls and a roof","b":"core1000","img":"art/words/building.jpg"},"opens":{"l":"open","p":"verb","i":"/ˈoʊpənz/","d":"starts to be used for the first time","b":"core1000","img":"art/words/open.jpg"},"in":{"l":"in","p":"prep","i":"/ɪn/","d":"inside a place or country","b":"core1000","img":null},"mexico":{"l":"Mexico","p":"name","i":"/ˈmɛksɪkoʊ/","d":"a country in North America","b":"beyond","img":null},"now":{"l":"